WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.800
On 28 July 2025,

2
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.800
President Mohamed Ould Cheikh El
Ghazouani laid the foundation stone

3
00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:28.100
of the Nouadhibou School of Technical
Education and Vocational Training in ICT,

4
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:32.100
a step that reflects the
commitment to vocational training

5
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.300
and to young people's skills in
technology and communication.

6
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.200
After the foundation stone was laid,
work began on this educational landmark,

7
00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:58.200
supervised by the Ministry of Housing,
Urban Planning and Land Development,

8
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:04.200
to modern standards suited to
technical and vocational training.

9
00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:22.000
The project includes complete
facilities: nine classrooms,

10
00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.900
a 150-seat lecture theatre,

11
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.300
sixteen rooms for laboratories,
workshops and storage,

12
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:38.000
fourteen administrative offices,
twenty-two teachers' offices,

13
00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:43.900
two meeting rooms and a large staff room.

14
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:59.200
It also has a 300-seat canteen,

15
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:06.500
an electrical substation, a
generator, concrete roads,

16
00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.800
indoor and outdoor car parks,

17
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:15.000
and housing: forty rooms for male students

18
00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.300
and two rooms adapted for
people with disabilities,

19
00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.200
forty rooms for female students

20
00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.900
and two rooms adapted for
people with disabilities,

21
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.500
and two staff residences.

22
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:33.400
The total cost of the project
is 174 million ouguiyas.

23
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.700
Work has reached an advanced stage,

24
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:44.000
heralding a modern, fully
equipped home for this school.

25
00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.600
Progress on this project
has reached 65% so far.

26
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.400
The works are carried out
by the company SOBAFOR,

27
00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.600
and monitored by the Ministry of Housing,

28
00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:06.600
which receives a weekly
report on progress.

29
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.600
It also has a permanent
monitoring office here,

30
00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:17.200
its eyes on site, reporting
progress to it every day.

31
00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.300
This new building marks a turning point

32
00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:45.500
for the school, which has rented modest
premises in Nouadhibou since it was founded.

33
00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:50.700
The new facility will let it carry
out its teaching and training work

34
00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:55.700
in better conditions, train
young talent more effectively

35
00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:59.000
and supply the job market
with the skills it needs.

36
00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.200
This school was created by decree in 2022,

37
00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:12.000
but since then its capacity
has remained limited,

38
00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:16.500
and so has the number of students.

39
00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:22.500
But with this new project, whose foundation
stone the President laid in 2025,

40
00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:30.800
a major project, thank God, which
increases the school's capacity

41
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:35.600
and the quality of training, as
part of the national strategy

42
00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:42.000
to raise the standard of vocational training
in Nouadhibou and across Mauritania.

43
00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.800
This project is about more
than a new learning space:

44
00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:03.100
it is an important step in
delivering the election programme

45
00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:08.700
of President Mohamed Ould Cheikh El
Ghazouani, "My Ambition for the Nation",

46
00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:16.300
which puts human capital and young people's
skills at the heart of national priorities.

47
00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:22.100
The project also provides a modern,
complete learning environment

48
00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:30.200
for training in modern technologies,
IT, multimedia and telecommunications,

49
00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:36.600
raising the quality of training in
step with rapid technological change,

50
00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:43.900
and gives young people more chances
to gain the skills and experience

51
00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:49.400
they need to find work and
contribute to national development.
